@startuml
title Cache-Aside: Изменение статуса заказа и инвалидация кеша

actor "Оператор" as Operator
participant "MES SPA\n(React)" as Frontend
participant "MES API\n(C#)" as API
database "MES DB\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB
database "Redis\n(Cache)" as Cache
queue "RabbitMQ" as RMQ

Operator -> Frontend: Нажимает "Взять в работу"\n(заказ #12345)
Frontend -> API: PATCH /api/orders/12345/status\n{status: "MANUFACTURING_STARTED"}
activate API

API -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
activate DB

API -> DB: UPDATE orders\nSET status = 'MANUFACTURING_STARTED'\nWHERE id = 12345
API -> DB: INSERT INTO order_history\n(order_id, status, changed_by, timestamp)
DB --> API: OK
API -> DB: COMMIT
deactivate DB

API -> RMQ: Publish "OrderStatusChanged"\n{orderId: 12345, status: MANUFACTURING_STARTED}
activate RMQ
RMQ --> API: ACK
deactivate RMQ

note right of API: Инвалидация кеша\nпосле успешной записи в БД

API -> Cache: DEL dashboard:orders:status:SUBMITTED:*
activate Cache
Cache --> API: OK
deactivate Cache

API -> Cache: DEL dashboard:orders:status:MANUFACTURING_STARTED:*
activate Cache
Cache --> API: OK
deactivate Cache

API -> Cache: DEL order:detail:12345
activate Cache
Cache --> API: OK
deactivate Cache

note right of API: Удаляем все затронутые\nкешированные данные

API --> Frontend: 200 OK
deactivate API
Frontend --> Operator: Статус обновлён, список обновится
@enduml